<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My First HTML Challenge</title>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1> Welcome to My Website</h1>
        <p> Hi! I am Gita. Currently learning HTML without CSS and JavaScript.</p>

        <nav>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>
    <hr>

    <main>
    <section id="about">
        <h2> About </h2>
        <p>This section is for how much I have learned in a day.</p>
        <ul>
            <li>tags like html, header, ul, main, section</li>
            <li>inserting images</li>
            <li>making a form</li>
            <li>insertion fonts</li>
        </ul>
    
     </section>
     <hr>
    
     <section id="projects">
        <h2>Projets I have learned/made</h2>
        <p>This section will be about the projects.</p>

        <h2>Project 1</h2>
        <p><em>cat</em></p>
        <img src="cat.jpg"><alt>Cat</alt>

        <hr>

        <h2>Project 2</h2>
        <p><strong>form</strong></p>
        
        <form>
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input
            name:"name"
            type: "text"
            placeholder="Enter your name"     
            >
            <br>
            <label for="age">Age</label>
            <input
            id="age"
            type: "number"
            placeholder="Enter your age"     
            >
        </form>
     </section>
     <hr>
     <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Me</h2>
        <form>
            <label for="email">Email:</label>
            <input
            id:"email"
            type: "text"
            placeholder="Enter your email"     
            >
            <br>
            <label for="message">Message:</label>
            <input
            id="message"
            type: "text"
            placeholder="Enter your message"  
            aria-rowcount="60"   
            >
        </form>
        
    </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
